  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Purple Mountain True Monarch’s inheritance records many soul path methods, and one of them is this refinement of a Gu Immortal soul. Fang Yuan holds Fairy Cui Bo’s Gu Immortal soul after Bai Ning Bing soul searches her, and considers the method among other uses for that soul.",
