        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fairy Cui Bo has rank seven cultivation, so refining her this way would produce an ancient soul beast. After the refinement, Fang Yuan would not need enslavement path methods; the resulting soul beast would obey with absolute loyalty. Gu Immortal souls, especially human Gu Immortal souls with higher cultivation, also yield more guts Gu when smashed on Dang Hun Mountain, so that remains an alternative use of the same soul.",
